    },
    turnFlow: "1. **Trumps**: The higher end of the turn-up tile is the trump suit. 2. **The Miss (Widow)**: In 3-4 player games, an extra hand of 5 tiles is dealt. Players can swap their hand for 'The Miss' or drop out. 3. **Dealer's Swap**: If the dealer keeps their hand, they can swap one tile for the turn-up trump tile. 4. **Trick Play**: Lead any tile. Must follow suit (if lead is a 5-2, the suit is 5). If unable to follow, must play a trump if held.",
